    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ddc7761f37d80cc55e48262",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在我的心中，绽放出即使暴露在苦难风暴中，\n也绝不会凋零的――\n觉悟之花。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09df79dda38fdf3a0acc5f0987d40b8f58a2b696a5e0f2236abffb80b7648d35",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134711.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cba4bab9e8233193d5dafb91",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那么，就先把根基打牢吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f80b42c84f87393806dbf0ff919030ba824fd509f6c131baa4d5eddcbd255c6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134711.json",
