      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对不起――我有些在意书架的凌乱，\n所以就帮忙整理了起来――\n之后，我会注意的……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef8b6b9195f13f4e523fd6fbe7020643ac7ef3c17b9bdfd0383560d7838797a4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
